Fixed. The bug was the `break;` inside the loop at `src/url_utils.ts:14` — it exited after stripping only the first matching tracking param, so any subsequent ones (`fbclid` when `utm_source` was present, etc.) were left in the URL.

Removed the `break;` so the loop now iterates through all of `TRACKING_PARAMS` and deletes every one present. No other code references `normalizeUrl`, so nothing else depends on the old behavior.


